<section class="mag-cover mag-cover--pair mag-cover--movement" aria-labelledby="mag-title">
        <div class="mag-cover__art" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="{{ 'serqua-mag-cover-movement.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="1920" height="1080" alt="" fetchpriority="high" />
        </div>
        <div class="mag-cover__shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="mag-cover__masthead">
          <p class="mag-cover__label">Strength · beauty · culture · and you</p>
          <h1 id="mag-title"><span>Serqua</span><em>Mag 01</em></h1>
          <div class="mag-cover__intro">
            <h2>Welcome to the Serqua world.</h2>
            <p>Wellness should never compromise on a life well lived.<br />Welcome to a space for better living, where science, skin and strength come together to find a balance</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mag-cover__notes" aria-label="Issue details">
          <p>More than<br />a supplement</p>
          <p>The first<br />edition</p>
        </div>
        <a class="mag-cover__enter" href="#issue-one">Read the issue <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      </section>

      <div class="mag-breath" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <section class="mag-opening" id="issue-one" aria-labelledby="opening-title">
        <p class="mag-running-line"><span></span> Movement looks different on everyone — and that’s the point. <span></span></p>
        <div class="mag-opening__grid">
          <figure class="mag-opening__group mag-opening__group--strength">
            <img src="{{ 'serqua-mag-cover-strength-updated.jpeg' | asset_url }}" width="960" height="1280" alt="Athlete wearing sunglasses and holding a Prollagen Bourbon Vanilla jar" />
            <figcaption>People · movement · perspective</figcaption>
          </figure>

          <header class="mag-opening__copy mag-opening__copy--resilience">
            <p class="mag-folio">Serqua Mag 01 / Story 01</p>
            <h2 id="opening-title">REPETITION &amp; RESILIENCE</h2>
            <div class="mag-opening__story">
              <p>Strength is rarely about just one big moment. It is repetition, resilience, and restraint.</p>
              <p>“Serqua” draws inspiration from the scorpion, a creature from unforgiving terrain of the desert, it survives, adapts, and remains remarkably equipped for its environment.</p>
              <p>a body is built on consistency, and resilience is built through everything that asks you not to keep going.</p>
            </div>
          </header>

          <div class="mag-slider" data-mag-slider tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Issue 01 portrait story carousel">
            <div class="mag-slider__track" data-slider-track>
              <figure class="mag-slide" data-slide>
                <img class="mag-slide__artwork" src="{{ 'serqua-beauty-build.jpeg' | asset_url }}" width="1024" height="1536" alt="Beauty &amp; the Build — The synergy of protein &amp; vitamin C" />
              </figure>
              <figure class="mag-slide" data-slide>
                <img class="mag-slide__artwork" src="{{ 'beauty-build-02.jpeg' | asset_url }}" width="1024" height="1536" alt="Beauty needs building blocks — whey protein and collagen" loading="lazy" />
              </figure>
              <figure class="mag-slide" data-slide>
                <img class="mag-slide__artwork" src="{{ 'beauty-build-03.jpeg' | asset_url }}" width="1024" height="1536" alt="Collagen amino acids and vitamin C" loading="lazy" />
              </figure>
              <figure class="mag-slide" data-slide>
                <img class="mag-slide__artwork" src="{{ 'beauty-build-04.jpeg' | asset_url }}" width="1024" height="1536" alt="Prollagen combines these three together" loading="lazy" />
              </figure>
              <figure class="mag-slide" data-slide>
                <img class="mag-slide__artwork" src="{{ 'beauty-build-05.jpeg' | asset_url }}" width="1024" height="1536" alt="Protein, collagen, vitamin C and MSM — formulation overview" loading="lazy" />
              </figure>
              <figure class="mag-slide" data-slide>
                <img class="mag-slide__artwork" src="{{ 'beauty-build-06.jpeg' | asset_url }}" width="1024" height="1536" alt="Beauty and the build, in one place — Serqua" loading="lazy" />
              </figure>
            </div>
            <button class="mag-editorial__arrow mag-editorial__arrow--prev" type="button" data-slider-prev aria-label="Previous Beauty and the Build slide">←</button>
            <button class="mag-editorial__arrow mag-editorial__arrow--next" type="button" data-slider-next aria-label="Next Beauty and the Build slide">→</button>
            <p class="mag-slider__count" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><span data-slider-current>01</span> / <span data-slider-total>06</span></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mag-feature mag-feature--quote" aria-labelledby="feature-title">
        <figure class="mag-feature__image">
          <img src="{{ 'catalog-handstand.jpeg' | asset_url }}" alt="Athlete holding a controlled handstand in a bright studio" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="1600" />
          <figcaption>Consistency · creativity · results</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <div class="mag-feature__headline">
          <p class="mag-folio">The daily practice</p>
          <h2 id="feature-title">Fuel what<br />moves you</h2>
        </div>
        <aside class="mag-feature__aside">
          <blockquote class="mag-feature__quote">
            <p>“Sanju here. I love pushing the limits of what my body is capable of in terms of not only raw strength but physical expression through movement, like Yoga and Calesthenics. Dynamic movements like these help me regulate my nervous system, and keep my body light and free. This along with breathwork builds mind-muscle intuition that allows me to live a more happy and fulfilled life. See a tree I like? I’ll just climb it then and there. Ciao :)”</p>
            <cite class="mag-feature__author">Sanjan Suresh</cite>
          </blockquote>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section class="mag-campaign" id="campaign" aria-labelledby="campaign-title">
        <div class="mag-campaign__nutrition">
          <p>Nutritional information</p>
          <dl>
            <div><dt>24g</dt><dd>Whey protein isolate</dd></div>
            <div><dt>7g</dt><dd>Marine collagen</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <p>+ Vitamin C<br />+ MSM</p>
          <p class="mag-campaign__closing">Performance<br />Recovery<br />Beauty<br />In one.</p>
        </div>
        <figure class="mag-campaign__product">
          <img src="{{ 'prollagen-campaign-product-v2.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Prollagen Bourbon Vanilla jar displayed on glossy black volcanic rocks" loading="lazy" width="1112" height="1415" />
        </figure>
        <div class="mag-campaign__copy">
          <h2 id="campaign-title">Prollagen</h2>
          <p class="mag-campaign__tagline">Better lifts. Better skin.</p>
          <ul class="mag-campaign__benefits" aria-label="Product benefits">
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 20h18v8H15M7 12h8v24H7zM33 12h8v24h-8zM3 18h4v12H3zM41 18h4v12h-4z"/></svg><strong>Muscle</strong><span>support</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 3c0 11-4 15-13 17 9 2 13 6 13 17 2-11 6-15 15-17-9-2-13-6-15-17ZM36 27c0 5-2 8-7 9 5 1 7 4 7 9 1-5 3-8 8-9-5-1-7-4-8-9ZM36 3v10M31 8h10"/></svg><strong>Healthy</strong><span>skin</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="20"/><path d="M24 8v16h12M34 11v10M29 16h10"/></svg><strong>Immunity</strong><span>boost</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 35C1 17 22 8 43 3c-3 22-12 41-31 31M5 44 34 13"/></svg><strong>Overall</strong><span>wellness</span></li>
          </ul>
          <a class="mag-campaign__cta" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Shop now <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <p class="mag-campaign__signature">More than a supplement</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mag-editorial" aria-labelledby="collagen-title" aria-roledescription="carousel" data-editorial-slider>
        <header class="mag-editorial__header">
          <div><p class="mag-folio">Serqua Mag / The reading room</p><h2 id="collagen-title">Decoding collagen.</h2></div>
          <p>Five pages. One deeper look.</p>
        </header>
        <figure class="mag-editorial__lifestyle">
          <img src="{{ 'catalog-gallery-recovery.jpeg' | asset_url }}" alt="Athlete stretching with a Prollagen jar in front of him" width="960" height="1280" loading="lazy" />
        </figure>
        <div class="mag-editorial__viewport" tabindex="0" aria-label="Collagen story. Use left and right arrow keys to turn pages.">
          <figure data-editorial-slide><img src="{{ 'collagen-story-01.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Decoding collagen: the science behind the shine — cover" width="1024" height="1536" loading="lazy" /></figure>
          <figure data-editorial-slide hidden><img src="{{ 'collagen-story-02.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Decoding collagen: collagen synthesis and vitamin C" width="1024" height="1536" loading="lazy" /></figure>
          <figure data-editorial-slide hidden><img src="{{ 'collagen-story-03.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Decoding collagen: illustrated skin changes" width="1024" height="1536" loading="lazy" /></figure>
          <figure data-editorial-slide hidden><img src="{{ 'collagen-story-04.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Skin-care isn’t just on the outside" width="1024" height="1536" loading="lazy" /></figure>
          <figure data-editorial-slide hidden><img src="{{ 'collagen-story-05-updated.jpeg' | asset_url }}" alt="Stay balanced from the inside-out with Prollagen" width="1024" height="1536" loading="lazy" /></figure>
          <button class="mag-editorial__arrow mag-editorial__arrow--prev" type="button" data-editorial-prev aria-label="Previous page">←</button>
          <button class="mag-editorial__arrow mag-editorial__arrow--next" type="button" data-editorial-next aria-label="Next page">→</button>
        </div>
        <div class="mag-editorial__controls">
          <span data-editorial-count role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">01 / 05</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mag-after" aria-labelledby="after-title">
        <article class="mag-after__lead mag-after__lead--movement">
          <div class="mag-after__copy">
            <p class="mag-folio">Discipline builds freedom</p>
            <h2 id="after-title">The anatomy of movement</h2>
            <div class="mag-after__story">
              <p>The smallest movements can impact your emotional atmosphere, triggering neurochemicals to release.<br />Endorphins lift you, serotonin balances you, and dopamine motivates you.</p>
              <p>Movement also increases blood flow, delivering more oxygen to the brain and body.<br />Even a short walk can shift your energy, focus, and sense of wellbeing.</p>
              <p>Consistent movement regulates stress and supports a more resilient nervous system.</p>
              <p>Movement is more than physical. It is a conversation between the body and the brain every move leaving an imprint.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <figure class="mag-after__movement">
            <img src="{{ 'catalog-anatomy-movement.jpeg' | asset_url }}" alt="Two poses of an athlete in black holding dumbbells" width="900" height="1200" loading="lazy" />
            <figcaption>Rituals that fit real life</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </article>

        <div class="mag-after__gallery">
          <figure class="mag-after__portrait">
            <img src="{{ 'catalog-gallery-training-pair.jpeg' | asset_url }}" alt="Two athletes with a shaker and Prollagen jar in a warm studio" loading="lazy" width="960" height="1280" />
            <figcaption>Real people. Real progress.</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="mag-after__motion">
            <img src="{{ 'prollagen-ritual-bag-updated.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Athlete packing a Prollagen jar into his gym bag" loading="lazy" width="5400" height="7200" />
            <figcaption>More than a look</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="mag-after__ritual">
            <img src="{{ 'collagen-story-lifestyle.jpeg' | asset_url }}" alt="Athlete tying his shoe beside a ladder, with a Prollagen jar, shaker and gym bag" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="1600" />
            <figcaption>The ritual continues</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mag-conclusion" aria-labelledby="conclusion-title">
        <p class="mag-folio">Fitness / beauty / recovery / community / and everything in between</p>
        <div class="mag-conclusion__grid mag-conclusion__grid--letter">
          <div class="mag-conclusion__title">
            <h2 id="conclusion-title">THE ART OF HAVING IT ALL.</h2>
            <p class="mag-conclusion__edition">SerquaMag 01</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mag-conclusion__letter">
            <p>There’s something so exhausting when you’re being told that looking and feeling good requires a perfectly curated life.</p>
            <p>Wake up at 5 am. Train. Eat clean. Sleep eight hours. Meditate.<br />Repeat, repeat, repeat.</p>
            <p>Real balance isn’t about being perfectly disciplined every second. It’s about knowing how to move between the different parts of your life , and still feeling like yourself at the end of the day.</p>
            <p>From the gym session to the dinner reservation, the skincare routine and the late night. The perfectly planned week and the weekend bender that absolutely was not…</p>
            <p>Welcome to SerquaMag.<br />The world is yours, we’re only making it better.</p>
            <p class="mag-conclusion__signoff">Stay tuned</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

